                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today, after touring the @wvamwater Kanawha Valley Water Treatment Plant, I held a roundtable with industry leaders to discuss my bill, the RESILIENCE Act. \n\nThis bipartisan legislation ensures repair costs are counted when figuring out utility companies\u2019 minimum taxes. By keeping prices low for our utility companies, they can secure the most affordable prices for their customers.",
